  "description": "Per-pixel harmonic regression (annual + sub-annual Fourier terms) across a multi-date collection: y(t) = a0 + Σ_k [ a_k·sin(2πkt/365.25) + b_k·cos(2πkt/365.25) ] with t in real acquisition days since the collection reference epoch. Solved in closed form (weighted least squares) with optional IRLS outlier damping. Outputs one fitted band per acquisition date plus RMSE and R²; optionally the raw coefficients. Pixels with fewer than minObservations valid samples stay NoData.",
  "display_name": "Temporal Harmonic Fit",
